# =============================================================================
# Production checklist — DO NOT put real secrets in this file.
#
# Deployed web (Vercel) reads environment variables from the Vercel dashboard.
# Do not assign KEY=value here: empty values can override Vercel at build time.
# This file is a reference of which keys to configure on Vercel.
#
# Local development uses apps/web/.env.local instead (Next.js loads it automatically).
# =============================================================================
#
# Required on Vercel:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL           (e.g. https://api.foresteacafe.com)
#   AUTH_SECRET
#   AUTH_URL                      (e.g. https://foresteacafe.com)
#   INTERNAL_API_SECRET           (must match the API on Railway)
#   ADMIN_EMAILS
#
# Optional — Google OAuth:
#   AUTH_GOOGLE_ID
#   AUTH_GOOGLE_SECRET
#
# Optional (if web talks to DB directly):
#   DATABASE_URL
